  "2026-07-09T21:36:10.062Z",codex-reporting,2026-07-09 codex-reporting resumed the existing nonduplicate readiness item. Unrelated local work is preserved; external Slack delivery will use only a local mock webhook.
  "2026-07-10T18:58:32.782Z",context-specialist,"2026-07-10 context-specialist: Fixed EXTENSION_VERSION 0.2.0 -> 2026.7.6 (major version mismatch). Updated peerDep to >=2026.7.10. Untracked dist/ from git, standardized .gitignore. Regenerated stale CHANGELOG. typecheck+build+test(54 pass)+pack(50.4KB)+changelog all green. npm@2026.7.10 published, CI+release green. No secrets in history."
notes[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-09T21:36:10.062Z",codex-reporting,"Evidence will be appended as each dependency, command, artifact, security/history, Greptile, CI, review, and merge gate completes."
  "2026-07-10T18:58:33.110Z",context-specialist,"Decision: Previous agent's parseNodeFilter dedup (Map-based merge) and shapeGraph broader filter application are production-ready. EXTENSION_VERSION was stuck at 0.2.0 from early development."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-10T18:58:33.397Z",context-specialist,"pm-graph commands are registered as 'pm-graph <subcommand>' (e.g. 'pm pm-graph analyze'), not 'pm graph <subcommand>'. Only 'pm graph export' appears under the 'pm graph' group."
